      "body": "24 words in two halves. First the press and the arts — who writes and reports, what gets published, and the parts of a film: scene, ending, comedy, drama.\nThen sound and speech: voice, noise, shout, chat, conversation.",
      "body_cz": "24 slov ve dvou částech: tisk a umění, potom slova pro zvuk a mluvení."
